OL,3,A'I live with a ghost': Japan's haunted
OL,4,Ahomes attract bargain hunters
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom the moment Ryua first walked into
OL,7,Fher rental apartment in Tokyo she
OL,8,Fbelieved it to be haunted.
OL,10,F"When I visited the place for a viewing
OL,11,Fthere was a man standing there, glaring
OL,12,Fat me," she says.
OL,14,F"Since the estate agent couldn't see
OL,15,Fhim, I realised he must be a ghost."
OL,17,FWhile someone more squeamish would
OL,18,Fprobably have quickly left the flat
OL,19,Fnever to return, Ryua chose to go ahead
OL,20,Fand move in.
